#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of quickjs.c lines 59759-59824: js_typed_array_base_funcs,
#       js_typed_array_base_proto_funcs, js_typed_array_funcs (one BYTES_PER_ELEMENT
#       entry per element size, indexed by typed_array_size_log2),
#       js_uint8array_proto_funcs and js_uint8array_funcs.
#
#==============================================================================================

